examples.misuse:
In order to get a new <code>Cipher</code> object one of the following <code>getInstance</code> methods must be called:<pre>Cipher.getInstance(String transformation);
Cipher.getInstance(String transformation, String provider);
Cipher.getInstance(String transformation, Provider provider);</pre>The <code>String transformation</code> can be formed as either of the following: <ul><li>"algorithm/mode/padding"</li><li>"algorithm"</li></ul>Calling the <code>init</code> method could be any of the following calls:<pre>c.init(int encmode, Certificate certificate);
c.init(int encmode, Certificate certificate, random);
c.init(int encmode, Key key);
c.init(int encmode, Key key, AlgorithmParameterSpec paramSpec);
c.init(int encmode, Key key, AlgorithmParameters params);
c.init(int encmode, Key key, AlgorithmParameterSpec paramSpec, SecureRandom random);
c.init(int encmode, Key key, AlgorithmParameters params, SecureRandom random);
c.init(int encmode, Key key, SecureRandom random);</pre>

examples.solution:
The method <code>init</code> should <b>not</b> be called if the algorithm used for <code>getInstance</code> is one of the following:<ul><li>AES</li><li>PBEWithHmacSHA224AndAES_128</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA256AndAES_128</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA384AndAES_128</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA512AndAES_128</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA224AndAES_256</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA256AndAES_256</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA384AndAES_256</li> <li>PBEWithHmacSHA512AndAES_256</li></ul><br>If the value of <code>encmode</code> is <b>not</b> <code>1</code> or <code>ENCRYPT_MODE</code> <b>and</b> the <code>mode</code> is one of the following:<ul><li>CTR</li><li>CTS</li><li>CFB</li><li>OFB</li></ul>then the following method configurations should <b>not</b> be called:<pre>c.init(encmode, certificate);
c.init(encmode, certificate, random);
c.init(encmode, key);
c.init(encmode, key, random);</pre><br>Also, if the <code>mode</code> is one of the following:<ul><li>CTR</li><li>CTS</li><li>CFB</li><li>ECB</li><li>OFB</li></ul>then the following methods should <b>not</b> be called:<pre>c.updateAAD(byte[] aadBytes);
c.updateAAD(byte[] aadBytes, int aadOffset, int aadLen);
c.updateAAD(ByteBuffer aadByteBuffer);</pre>
